    "body": "I know it's something @domenic has had bouncing around his head. I'm hoping this iframe hack shows it could be easier than we initially thought.\r\n\r\nI'd love to be able to do:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst div = document.createElement('div');\r\ndocument.body.appendChild(div);\r\nconst response = await fetch(url);\r\nawait response.body.pipeTo(div.writable);\r\n```\r\n\r\n…or something.",
