    "created_at": "2017-05-12T20:50:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-05-12T20:50:56Z",
    "body": "Note that Edge allows less than Chrome (and I assume Safari) here; in Jake's reduced test case, it only logs \"Inline script\", and not \"Inline script\" + \"External script\" as Chrome does.\r\n\r\nI'm going to write tests against this behavior and hopefully Chrome can conform with the current spec as part of also fixing https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/2673.",
